lid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Global"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Limited (sanctions, trust issues)"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","p","239",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*Sources: Industry analysis, company disclosures*"}]]}],["$","p","241",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The competitive implications are significant. As China's domestic chip market grows toward ¥1.3 trillion, it will fund R&D investments that close the remaining performance gaps. Cambricon's current R&D budget is a fraction of Nvidia's, but if the company maintains its profit trajectory and market valuation, that gap will narrow."}]]}],["$","p","243",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"More importantly, the software ecosystem is maturing. MindSpore — Huawei's AI framework — has grown from a political alternative to a genuinely capable platform. Chinese developers increasingly build models natively for domestic hardware rather than porting from CUDA."}]]}],["$","h3","245",{"style":{"fontSize":"22px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"32px 0 16px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The Talent Question"}]]}],["$","p","247",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The ultimate competitive factor isn't capital or market size — it's talent. China's universities graduate more electrical engineers and computer scientists than the rest of the world combined. As the domestic chip industry generates profits and prestige, it's attracting the country's best technical minds."}]]}],["$","p","249",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Baidu's newly formed Model Committee (BMC), announced May 15, 2026, is instructive: it's staffed by \"young researchers with deep understanding of large models\" — a signal that China's tech giants are reorganizing to compete in AI at the organizational level, not just the product level. The same organizational intensity is happening in chip design."}]]}],["$","hr","251",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","253",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Social Media Reaction: What Chinese Tech Users Are Saying"}]]}],["$","p","255",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The earnings reports triggered intense discussion on Weibo, Xiaohongshu, and Zhihu. Here are representative comments:"}]]}],["$","blockquote","260",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Weibo user @科技投资笔记"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"寒武纪一季报净利润10亿，现金流转正，这意味着国产AI芯片真的开始赚钱了。不再是‘国家补贴’的故事，而是‘市场需求’的故事。\""}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"Cambricon's ¥1B profit and positive cash flow mean domestic AI chips are actually making money now. No longer a 'state subsidy' story — it's a 'market demand' story.\"*"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","264",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Zhihu user @芯片从业者"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"海光信息的DCU营收14亿，同比增长120%，这才是真正的大杀器。CUDA兼容不是技术妥协，是商业核武器。\""}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"Hygon's DCU revenue of ¥1.4B with 120% growth — that's the real weapon. CUDA compatibility isn't a technical compromise, it's a commercial nuclear bomb.\"*"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","268",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Xiaohongshu user @金融打工喵"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"昆仑芯外销占比过半，这才是我最关注的。百度自己养的芯片公司，终于能独立走路了。IPO之后估计估值要翻倍。\""}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"Kunlun Core's external sales exceeding 50% — that's what I care about most. Baidu's pet chip company can finally walk on its own. Post-IPO valuation will probably double.\"*"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","272",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Weibo user @半导体老炮"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"41%国产份额意味着每卖两块AI加速卡，就有一块是国产的。这放在三年前谁敢信？\""}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"41% domestic share means for every two AI accelerators sold, one is domestic. Who would have believed this three years ago?\"*"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","276",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"雪球用户 @价值投机2025"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"摩尔线程居然盈利了！我去年还说这家公司活不过2026，打脸了。GPU四小龙里，它可能是最被低估的。\""}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"Moore Threads is actually profitable! I said last year this company wouldn't survive 2026. I was wrong. Among the 'GPU Four Dragons,' it may be the most underrated.\"*"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","280",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Twitter/X user @ChinaTechInsight (English)"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"The Q1 numbers from Cambricon and Hygon aren't just earnings beats — they're proof that China's chip sanctions are accelerating domestic substitution faster than anyone in DC predicted. The 41% market share figure should terrify semiconductor strategists.\""}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"The Q1 numbers from Cambricon and Hygon aren't just earnings beats — they're proof that China's chip sanctions are accelerating domestic substitution faster than anyone in DC predicted. The 41% market share figure should terrify semiconductor strategists.\"*"}]]}]]}],["$","hr","281",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","283",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The Bottom Line"}]]}],["$","p","285",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"China's AI chip industry has reached an inflection point that changes the strategic calculus for every player in global AI. The Q1 2026 earnings weren't outliers — they were the confirmation of a multi-year trend that has now reached commercial escape velocity."}]]}],["$","p","287",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Three conclusions stand out:"}]]}],["$","p","289",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"First, domestic AI chips are no longer just a political project."}],["$","span","1",{"children":" Cambricon's ¥10.13 billion quarterly profit, generated from cash-paying customers across multiple industries, proves that these products compete on economic merit."}]]}],["$","p","291",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Second, the 41% market share milestone in cloud AI accelerators is a tipping point."}],["$","span","1",{"children":" Above this threshold, network effects kick in: more customers attract more software developers, which attracts more customers. Nvidia's ecosystem advantage — the moat that has protected its dominance for a decade — is being challenged in the world's second-largest AI market."}]]}],["$","p","293",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Third, 2026 is the year the industry scales."}],["$","span","1",{"children":" With six major players (Cambricon, Hygon, Moore Threads, MetaX, Biren, Iluvatar) plus Huawei Ascend and Kunlun Core all p